<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-04T22:01:13.688Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 22:01:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drones have stepped up attacks on Sudan's eastern power infrastructure, causing widespread outages, while the Sudanese army shot down an FH-95 drone over West Kordofan. Sudan has lodged formal complaints against Ethiopia at the UN Security Council and the African Union over cross-border drone strikes. Displaced civilians returning to Khartoum and Darfur now confront new challenges, including heightened famine risk in Kalma camp and survivors pledging to document killings after recent camp attacks. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBvQk5ORVBaZjk4WEF5dVZwWDZaOVNidkJJZDFQOF9FWVZUR2ZRZkVReHZlV1N0N2kwazF3Rk1pZkFGSjZNN1dPdWl2SEhiYWhfekRfN1NIVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOWHJpbk9MTVE3MVZqdFlWeDVFblV2V1dZZWxlQzNpX1FxY3JpVDA4SDdENGY0N0tvcWlLTUsxQjFEczF2NVBMczdEdDdQNTFZNU4tUlJya3VBS1otM0VadnJGVXVSVTJzWTVpeVIyWmJKdzVJRXhoUlVfeEZSUG5waHp0eER1c1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
